  "excerpt": "<p>Coming Soon! We are very excited to announce that we will be offering Tibetan Herbal Foot Soaks to our patients very soon.  In China, foot soaks are commonly used both as a treatment and as a wellness tactic.  Now you too will be able to enjoy a foot soak in the privacy of your own [&hellip;]</p>\n",
  "image": "/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Artboard-1@sishou-1024x1024.png",
  "html": "<section id=\"section-56-2940\" class=\" ct-section\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(#4e4e4e, #4e4e4e), url(/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Foot-soak.jpg);background-size:auto,  cover;\" ><div class=\"ct-section-inner-wrap\"><h1 id=\"headline-18-2940\" class=\"ct-headline\"><span id=\"span-21-2940\" class=\"ct-span\" >Tibetan Herbal Foot Soaks-here soon!</span></h1></div></section><section id=\"section-35-2940\" class=\" ct-section\" ><div class=\"ct-section-inner-wrap\"><div id=\"div_block-49-2940\" class=\"ct-div-block\" ><div id=\"text_block-27-2940\" class=\"ct-text-block\" ><span id=\"span-28-2940\" class=\"ct-span oxy-stock-content-styles\" ><h2><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-2710\" src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Foot-soak-300x185.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"185\" srcset=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Foot-soak-300x185.jpg 300w, /media/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/Foot-soak.jpg 650w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /><em><strong>Coming Soon!</strong></em></h2>\n<p>We are very excited to announce that we will be offering Tibetan Herbal Foot Soaks to our patients very soon.  In China, foot soaks are commonly used both as a treatment and as a wellness tactic.  Now you too will be able to enjoy a foot soak in the privacy of your own home.</p>\n<p class=\"font_8\" data-reactid=\".0.$SITE_ROOT.$desktop_siteRoot.$PAGES_CONTAINER.$centeredContent.$inlineContent.$SITE_PAGES.$c20nh_DESKTOP.$inlineContent.$i3afje3i_1.$inlineContent.0.$child.$0.$inlineContent.$1.$5.$0.$richTextContainer.2\">The herbs in our soaks are <strong>sourced directly from small farms in Tibet and China</strong> and are part of a growing movement, benefiting small farmers bringing the best, high quality herbs directly to our clinic – and to you! The small company helping us get our herbs dedicates part of their profits to a Tibetan orphanage.</p>\n<p>These high quality herbal foot soaks are cultivated with great care in the high plateau of Tibet.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Tibetan Foot Soaks can treat these conditions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pain</strong>\n<div id=\"attachment_3936\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\" style=\"width: 371px;\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3936 \" src=\"https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea-300x168.jpg?x41190\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea-300x168.jpg 300w, https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea-768x431.jpg 768w, https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea-705x395.jpg 705w, https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea-450x252.jpg 450w, https://www.lotusleafacupuncture.com/media/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Tibet-region-for-soaks-and-tea.jpg 881w\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"208\" /></p>\n<p class=\"wp-caption-text\">Region where herbs are grown</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Inflammation</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Fibromyalgia</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Peripheral neuropathy</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Painful and Irregular menstruation</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Headaches</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Back pain</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cold hands and feet</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cold abdomen with diarrhea</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><em><strong>Stay Tuned!</strong></em></h3>\n</span></div><div id=\"div_block-22-2940\" class=\"ct-div-block\" ></div></div><div id=\"div_block-48-2940\" class=\"ct-div-block\" ><div id=\"widget-59-2940\" class=\"ct-widget\" ><div class=\"widget widget_categories\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Topics</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-338\"><a href=